<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Great Western, FirstFed.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Great Western, FirstFed.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers upgraded Great Western Financial Corp and FirstFed Financial Corp, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- FirstFed rose 1/8 to 19-3/4 and Great Western fell 3/8 to 24-7/8.</p>
</text>
